{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:58:05+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:58:05+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"1&1 AG","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"Germany","city":"Montabaur","website":"https://www.1und1.ag","employees":4602,"summary":"1&1 AG, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a telecommunications provider in Germany. It operates through three segments: Access; 1&1 Mobile Network; and 1&1 Versatel. The company offers mobile internet, broadband products, and related applications, such as home networks, online storage, telephony, and smart home or international protocol television for residential customers and small and medium sized enterprises. It also owns and operates mobile network based on OPEN RAN technology; and the sale of telecommunication devices and accessories. In addition, the company provides fibre-optic networks comprising direct fibre connection to bespoke; and individual ICT solutions, such as voice, data, and network solutions. The company provides its products and services under the 1&1, WinSIM, Sim.de, yourfone, smartmobil.de, simply, PremiumSIM, and DeutschlandSIM brands. The company was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Montabaur, Germany. 1&1 AG is a subsidiary of United Internet AG.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"1&1 AG, avec ses filiales, opère en tant que fournisseur de télécommunications en Allemagne. Elle opère à travers trois segments : Access ; 1&1 Mobile Network ; et 1&1 Versatel. La société propose l'Internet mobile, les produits à large bande et les applications connexes, telles que les réseaux domestiques, le stockage en ligne, la téléphonie et la télévision à domicile intelligente ou la télévision protocolaire internationale pour les clients résidentiels et les petites et moyennes entreprises."},"valuation":{"m